# Downloaded corpus caches. 39 MB of scraped wikitext and Gutenberg plain text,
# reproducible with `npm run corpus:fetch-ru` and `npm run corpus:fetch`. The
# source lists that say what to download are checked in; the downloads are not.
/scripts/wikisource/
/scripts/gutenberg/
